STYLE Market:
COLOR IS PAPER.
Markets ARE A GRID.
Sum IS PICKED ON tens.
Item IS LONG.
Wish IS LONG.
Item IS NEW AS Item1.
Establish IS CALLED "Set up my identity".
Acquaint IS CALLED "Add a contact".
Acquaint IS IN THE MENU.
Open IS CALLED "Open a market".
Open IS PRIMARY.
Mart IS NEW AS Market1.
Make IS CALLED "Make an item".
Issue IS CALLED "Issue my own notes".
Issue IS IN THE MENU.
Withdraw IS CALLED "Withdraw a post".
Withdraw IS IN THE MENU.
Offer IS CALLED "Post an item".
Offer own IS CALLED "Post an item".
Want IS CALLED "Post a wish".
Want own IS CALLED "Post a wish".
Withdraw own IS CALLED "Withdraw my post".
Swap items IS CALLED "Offer a swap".
Swap items IS PRIMARY.
Swap item for coin IS CALLED "Sell for coins".
Swap item for bond IS CALLED "Sell for bonds".
Swap item for bond IS IN THE MENU.
Deposit item IS CALLED "Put in escrow".
Deposit item IS IN THE MENU.
Pay issuer IS CALLED "Pay back the issuer".
Deposit IS CALLED "Put in escrow".
Deposit IS IN THE MENU.
Redeem IS IN THE MENU.
Redeem coin against bond IS IN THE MENU.
Redeem bond IS IN THE MENU.
Redeem bond against bond IS IN THE MENU.
Introduce IS CALLED "Introduce to a contact".
Join IS CALLED "Admit to my market".
